{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7cd4b499973a6434c054694401f6ce7b7b3140eac2829da3a5d27acf7e6ee69a","ja":"悪だくみの相談！？","zh":"密谋商量！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"491da1b905a881f24d0fc0bb654fb046c8206c5e66cbe16edfd81655752666d2","ja":"この後は、みんなでお仕事の打ち合わせだよね。\n育たちって、もう来てるのかな？","zh":"之后大家要一起开工作会议对吧。\n育她们已经来了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"87a65218f1d00851ff29183af544fcca1e45caf728988edac4f5e2f9908bcdfb","ja":"部屋の中から、声が聞こえますね。\nもう話し合ってるのかも。","zh":"房间里面传出了说话声呢。\n可能已经在商量了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7fbdaf79741c0b2845b602edba8c8244f7db99d5b09d83722e9a7dde14d6eb56","ja":"今入ったら、おじゃまになっちゃうかな？","zh":"现在进去的话，会打扰到吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"99514eda47bd87b0c02b7f14799558ead721315410b9db73b8fb4ebbe933c152","ja":"そうね。会話が一区切りついたあたりで、\n合流したほうが……。","zh":"也是呢。等聊得差不多告一段落的时候，\n再去和她们会合比较好……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"17a3dbda64c3f72fe85c28f7dc4e3199a582b22bb6bdea218e816da2ebb5dc79","ja":"えーっと、じゃあ……わたし、\nここを、いーっぱい散らかしちゃおうかな？","zh":"嗯——那……我要不要\n把这里弄得乱——七八糟呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"38ab0a78b76a6c14e63b4ed7a14d1501270916dd6f4437b3148a13b410d68546","ja":"それじゃあ、たまきは……お菓子ばっかり食べて、\n夜ごはんを食べないようにしちゃうぞ♪","zh":"那环就……光吃点心，\n不吃晚饭啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"1802deece96fc82a719640265b868e920c86661ad8b794b93231375d3625fb9c","ja":"桃子は……宿題をしないで、\n遊んでようかな？","zh":"桃子要不要……先不做作业，\n去玩呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"6e9fbe661c0b6115f830fa808c1df31299e703be394843d7b771f2a20e63d5e1","ja":"はわっ！？　た、大変っ！\nみんなが、悪い子になる相談してますよ！？","zh":"哇哇！？不、不好了！\n大家正在商量怎么使坏呢！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"1aecf79482d21ea901e6297b63887a41490b1fff73f46604969d6c9a03a21a90","ja":"『いい子』をした反動かしら！？　と、とにかく。\nまずは3人から話を……あっ、ちょっと！　響！？","zh":"是当『乖孩子』的反作用吗！？总、总之。\n先从3个人开始问……啊，等等！响！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"c4c53c28ed0d1ffec46f16098c64ba5d144f014fd3afabdc31f48b9a678efa09","ja":"みんな、どうして急に悪い子になっちゃったの？\n自分、悲しいぞ！","zh":"大家怎么突然都变成坏孩子了？\n我好伤心啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"a401242a4bae876f43143339c3ff4d5fa21016401d12c3bf01cd420537dc1123","ja":"そ、そうだよ！　なにかあったんだったら、\n私たちに相談してくれたら……。","zh":"没、没错！要是有什么事的话，\n跟我们商量商量就好了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"345389171d96e3c5ea195781a9d126b508eb6d6b08e82fe58cb84dc215fb9b08","ja":"わあ～！？　なになになに～！？\nたまきたち、何かしたの～！？","zh":"哇～！？　怎么了怎么了怎么了～！？\n环她们，做了什么吗～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1750.unity3d","item_key":"commands[53].text","source_sha256":"74687ba492471b7165d7865319e1074f42963a37e1bcc23b556ce36807c9d878","ja":"……！　ちょっと待って！\n響さんたち、なんか変な誤解してる！","zh":"……！等一下！\n响她们好像产生了什么奇怪的误会！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
